<title>UK: RMC, Redland hit by Pilkington news.</title>
<headline>RMC, Redland hit by Pilkington news.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British building materials firms RMC Group Plc and Redland Plc fell on Tuesday after a Pilkington Plc trading statement said market conditions in Europe remained difficult.</p>
<p>RMC was 14p lower at 956 by 1015 GMT while Redland was down 9-1/2p at 347-1/2.</p>
